But what if the body contains a field that is also an ExtensionObject that gets unwrapped? The nested ExtensionObject would be decoded by `decodeJsonJumpTable[dst->type->typeKind]`. If the nested type contains an ExtensionObject member, it would be decoded by `ExtensionObject_decodeJson`.

